There's only like the keynotes,

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.800
there's like a couple things.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.130
I was very quiet.

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:23.310
And then when I came back,
I was more self-aware.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:24.220
And what did I start?

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:25.313
The #AskGaryVee Show.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.210
Sometimes when I talk to
Caleb or anybody at my team,

00:10:31.221 --> 00:10:35.250
I'm the breakout personality
in the business space

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:37.120
in this last couple years,

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:42.100
while actively being a CEO,
and CEO of a massive company.

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:43.160
And when I talk to them,

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.623
could you imagine if I was just Gary Vee?

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:48.760
Every morning, I would
do a fucking morning show

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:51.590
from 8:00 a.m. to 11:00 a.m., just Q&amp;A.

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:55.540
You think I'm penetrating
all the channels now?

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:56.880
It'd be over.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.030
I would do it everyday.

00:10:58.030 --> 00:10:59.530
It's my favorite thing to do.

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:01.010
Tea with Gary Vee!

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:02.620
You know, a nice glass of tea.

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:04.000
Just put 'em on, call me.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:06.540
Boom, boom, boom, boom, boom, boom,

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:07.870
clip, clip, clip,

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:09.510
distribute, distribute.

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:10.443
Everyday!

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:12.900
Look how pumped we get when we do-

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:15.440
One of the reasons I did
4Ds was for the fuckin',

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:16.490
what did I just say?

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:18.700
Because hiring is guessing.

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:19.980
Firing is knowing.

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:21.570
That fucking thing is
gonna kill on LinkedIn.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:22.976
That's two million in the bank.

00:11:22.976 --> 00:11:24.980
(laughing)

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:27.100
But I need to be asked.

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.733
It's hard to self-start.

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:32.210
It's not, I apologize, I'm
really great at self-starting,

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:33.070
that's why it was good.

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:34.730
It's just, I'm only
gonna say the same things

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:35.630
that I believe in.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:39.000
The only time I do new
shit is when I'm asked.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:39.833
That's why I started,

00:11:39.833 --> 00:11:41.059
and if you know that about yourself,

00:11:41.059 --> 00:11:43.834
make it a Q&amp;A show, right?

00:11:43.834 --> 00:11:45.400
- Yeah, just show much fun.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.320
- So fun, especially
when you stay in your-

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:50.290
The biggest thing I'll tell
you is just stay in your lane.

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:51.830
I think a lot of people,
when they start Q&amp;A,

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:53.410
have a sense of like, "I'm an expert

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.010
and I should have an answer for this."

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:57.480
It happened yesterday,
I don't know, right?

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:00.960
I have no ego, I've lived my own truth.

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:03.840
If I never write another
headline for myself,

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:05.850
then I wasn't good enough.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:06.683
I don't know, nonetheless,

00:12:06.683 --> 00:12:08.433
I'm super pumped to
tell them I don't know.

00:12:08.433 --> 00:12:11.516
(slow hip hop music)

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:25.190
(audience cheering)

00:12:27.729 --> 00:12:31.050
- The relationship between
success and failure,

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:32.946
how do you define success,

00:12:32.946 --> 00:12:35.010
and how is it related to failure?

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:37.360
- I define success as
waking up and being happy

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:40.492
and being able to do what
you want to do at all times.

00:12:40.492 --> 00:12:43.492
(audience applause)

00:12:45.151 --> 00:12:48.990
- ...it's apparent we have
everything to be successful now.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.543
- It's super simple,

00:12:52.997 --> 00:12:55.610
and we are absolutely
at an inflection point

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:58.191
where there is people like me
and different things happening

00:12:58.191 --> 00:13:01.313
where we're starting to have
different conversations.

00:13:02.244 --> 00:13:05.050
Freedom is what everybody's chasing,

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:07.610
but they're confused about
what it actually looks like.

00:13:07.610 --> 00:13:10.210
It's not how much you make,
it's how much you spend.

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:13.530
There's a lot of people
that could be way more free

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:16.667
if they didn't overextend
themselves on what they're buying.

00:13:16.667 --> 00:13:19.750
(slow hip hop music)

